---
const clients = [
  "Alita Construction Services",
  "ADM Home Services",
  "Pacific Premier Insurance Associates",
  "The Judge's Mansion",
];
---

<section class="clients dark" aria-label="Companies I have built for">
  <div class="wrap clients__inner">
    <p class="clients__label tag" data-reveal>Built for</p>
    <ul class="clients__list">
      {
        clients.map((c, i) => (
          <li data-reveal style={`--delay:${100 + i * 90}ms`}>
            {c}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section intro">
  <div class="wrap intro__grid">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2>
        One operator.<br />The whole system, <span class="accent">end to end</span>.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="intro__body">
      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:120ms">
        Most businesses do not lose work because the service is bad. They lose it in the gaps. A
        lead sits in an inbox for two days. A quote waits on someone to get back to a laptop.
        Progress updates live in a spreadsheet nobody fills in, so nobody knows where anything
        stands until a client asks.
      </p>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:200ms">
        I build the connective tissue that closes those gaps. Forms that capture the right
        information, pricing rules that fire instantly, quotes that go out while the customer is
        still interested, bookings that land in the system your team already uses, and a report that
        writes itself every week. You keep your tools. I make them talk to each other.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .clients {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    padding-block: 34px;
  }

  .clients__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px 40px;
  }

  .clients__label {
    flex: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .clients__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 34px;
  }

  .clients__list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: rgba(233, 237, 247, 0.72);
    position: relative;
    transition: color 0.3s var(--ease);
  }

  .clients__list li:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .intro__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .intro__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .intro__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
